  "title": "Use int for the size of the byte array in the constructor.",
  "description": "The size argument to QByteArray constructors is qsizetype in Qt 6, but\nit's int in Qt 5, and qsizetype might be larger than int.\n\nThat can cause shortening warnings.\n\nThe sizes fit in an int, so just use int for the size; widening int to\nqsizetype doesn't cause a problem.",
